    "long_copy": "Babies explore the world with every wiggle, stretch, and nap. That’s why we created CloudComfort Baby Diapers—engineered for comfort without sacrificing protection. Our FeatherSoft inner layer reduces friction against delicate skin, while Adaptive Stretch at the waist and legs provides a snug, flexible fit that moves with your baby. AirFlow channels promote breathability to help keep skin dry and comfortable throughout the day and night. The ultra-absorbent core locks wetness away for up to 12 hours, and a color-changing wetness indicator takes the guesswork out of changes. Hypoallergenic, lotion-free, and dermatologist tested, CloudComfort features a plant-based top sheet made with responsibly sourced materials. Gentle by design. Powerful in protection.",
