      },
      "scene_3": {
        "visual": "Animated cutaway: FeatherSoft liner, AirFlow channels, absorbent core.",
        "voiceover": "FeatherSoft liner to pamper delicate skin, AirFlow channels to keep it cool, and up to 12 hours of leak protection."
      },
