        "visual": "Baby giggles and crawls; waistband flexes comfortably.",
        "voiceover": "Adaptive Stretch for a snug fit that moves with your baby."
      },
      "scene_5": {
        "visual": "Parent checks wetness indicator, smiles.",
        "voiceover": "Hypoallergenic, lotion-free, and dermatologist tested."
      },
      "scene_6": {
        "visual": "Packaging and logo; on-screen offer: '20% off first pack—CLOUD20'.",
        "voiceover": "CloudComfort Baby Diapers. Softer snuggles. Drier days."
