      "body_copy": "CloudComfort’s FeatherSoft liner and AirFlow channels keep delicate skin comfortable—day and night. Up to 12 hours of leak protection. Hypoallergenic. Lotion-free. Dermatologist tested.",
      "cta": "Try CloudComfort today and save 20% with code CLOUD20."
    },
    "landing_page_sections": [
      {
        "title": "So Soft, They’ll Forget It’s There",
        "copy": "Our FeatherSoft inner layer minimizes friction to help reduce irritation and keep skin happy."
      },
      {
        "title": "Breathable by Design",
        "copy": "AirFlow channels promote ventilation to help keep baby’s skin cool and dry."
      },
      {
        "title": "Protection That Lasts",
        "copy": "An ultra-absorbent core locks wetness away for up to 12 hours—day or night."
      },
      {
