        "copy": "Hypoallergenic, lotion-free, dermatologist tested, with a plant-based top sheet from responsibly sourced materials."
      },
      {
        "title": "Find Your Size",
        "copy": "From Newborn to Size 6. Use our fit guide and enjoy free size exchanges on your first order."
      },
      {
        "title": "What Parents Are Saying",
        "copy": "“No leaks overnight and no red marks in the morning. We’re switching!” — Maya, mom of two"
      }
    ],
    "disclaimers": [
      "Up to 12 hours of protection based on average lab performance; results may vary.",
      "Hypoallergenic does not guarantee prevention of all allergic reactions.",
      "Plant-based refers to top sheet materials; product is not biodegradable."
